      "message": "fix(gate): add the light tier for the heavy tests\n\n`cargo xtask gate light` runs the light twins of the heavy tests in\nrelease: one release build of the crates that hold a twin, then one\nstep for each test target with a twin. A twin has the ignore reason\n`light lane: ...` and the name `<full test>_light`; the planner refuses\na twin whose file has no #[ignore]d full test. A red run prints the\nnote for the PR: each red step with the command of its full heavy step.\n\nThe first twin is the slot sweep of machining2d::adaptive (2 of its 20\nrows). The full sweep does not change.\n\nAGENTS.md names the light lane and the local full rerun after a red\ncut gate. The text for the gate and release-cut skills is owed: the\nworker session could not write in .claude/skills/.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nRefs #2569\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
